    "maxMemAllocMb": 4096
  },
  "options": {
    "renderDistance": 6,
    "simulationDistance": 4,
    "maxFps": 60,
    "graphicsMode": 0,
    "renderClouds": false,
    "entityShadows": false,
    "particles": 2,
    "entityDistanceScaling": 0.5,
    "mipmapLevels": 2,
    "biomeBlendRadius": 0
  },
  "iris": {
    "enableShaders": false
  },
  "notes": [
    "8 GB 物理内存不要把 Java 最大堆设置为 8 GB；必须给 Windows 和后台程序留出余量。",
    "建议减少 FTB Chunks 强制加载区块，并避免让高并发自动化长期运行。",
